{
  "name": "LINE 整合 AI 智慧客服助理（含對話記憶與免費回覆）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📱 範例 5：LINE 整合 AI 智慧客服助理\n\n1. **Webhook 觸發器**：接收使用者傳送的 LINE 訊息，並即時回覆 200 OK。\n2. **Code 節點**：精準解析 `replyToken`、`userId` 與 `userMessage`。\n3. **AI Agent**：串接 LLM 模型，並利用 `userId` 隔離 Window Buffer Memory。\n4. **HTTP Request**：呼叫 LINE Reply API 免費回傳 AI 產生的智慧回答。",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        120
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "line-ai-webhook",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        380
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-webhook-trigger",
      "name": "LINE Webhook 觸發器",
      "webhookId": "line-ai-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        80,
        240
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-respond-200",
      "name": "即時回傳 200 OK"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 解析 LINE Webhook Payload\nconst body = $input.first().json.body;\nif (!body || !body.events || body.events.length === 0) {\n  return [];\n}\n\nconst event = body.events[0];\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    eventType: event.type,\n    replyToken: event.replyToken || '',\n    userId: event.source?.userId || '',\n    messageType: event.message?.type || '',\n    userMessage: event.message?.text || ''\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        460
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-parse-event",
      "name": "解析 LINE 訊息事件"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-text-message",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.messageType }}",
              "rightValue": "text",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        460
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-check-text",
      "name": "是否為文字訊息？"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=LINE 使用者 ID：{{ $json.userId }}\n使用者問題：{{ $json.userMessage }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=你是一位專業、親切且高效的 LINE 官方客服智慧助理。請遵循以下規則：\n1. 必須一律使用「繁體中文（台灣習慣用語）」進行回覆。\n2. 語氣親切有禮，可適度使用 emoji 增加互動質感。\n3. 回答簡潔明瞭、重點突出，避免冗長無重點的文字。\n4. 若使用者提及先前的提問，請參考對話歷史記憶進行連貫回應。"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        560,
        460
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-agent-core",
      "name": "LINE AI 客服代理"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        680
      ],
      "id": "line-openai-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('解析 LINE 訊息事件').item.json.userId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        660,
        680
      ],
      "id": "line-ai-memory",
      "name": "對話記憶 (依 User ID 隔離)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.line.me/v2/bot/message/reply",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"replyToken\": \"{{ $('解析 LINE 訊息事件').item.json.replyToken }}\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \"{{ $json.output }}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        460
      ],
      "id": "send-line-ai-reply",
      "name": "呼叫 LINE Reply API 免費回傳",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "YOUR_LINE_HEADER_AUTH_ID",
          "name": "LINE Messaging API Header Auth"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "LINE Webhook 觸發器": {
